@@ -8188,3 +8188,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-02: REDO the discrimination-vs-selection diagnosis PROPERLY — exp3682 was a degenerate no-op (TAUTOLOGY-flagged, per_candidate_auroc collapsed to 0.555, identical 0.3443 'fixes'). Fix the corpus so discrimination reproduces (~0.93), then test GENUINELY-NEW methods: pessimistic LCB BoN (arXiv:2604.04648) + bootstrapped BoN (arXiv:2511.18630) + real per-question calibration + self-certainty composition (arXiv:2502.18581). Can an energy verifier's selection beat self-consistency, or is the decoupling fundamental (arXiv:2512.23067)? (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: blocked_no_multi_candidate_corpus; results/experiment_3694_selection_gap_proper_rediagnosis.json
 - 2026-06-02: Build a code-NATIVE verifier for the code-blind detector — exp3683 earned that reweighting MATH verifiers leaves code AUROC at 0.5; the fix is a code-NATIVE signal (AST/structural features + execution-trace / runtime instrumentation on the balanced code corpus exp3658), not a reweight. Does a code-native signal beat the 0.5 chance floor with a CI excluding 0.5? (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: code_native_signal_recovered_beats_chance_floor; results/experiment_3695_code_native_verifier.json
 - 2026-06-02: Re-ship the detector with a math+code operating point (gated on exp3695 code_signal_recovered==true) — wire the code-native verifier into python/carnot/pipeline/second_pair_detector.py, calibrate the code operating point, and re-run the E2E green; if the gate is not met the detector stays honestly math-only with an explicit abstain-on-code path (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: detector_reshipped_math_plus_code_operating_point_e2e_green; results/experiment_3696_reship_detector_math_plus_code.json
+- 2026-06-02: FR-11 continuous self-learning v12 — drift-RESET policy: when detected drift does not recover within a window, reset to the last-known-good dependency structure (forward diff from v11's continuous re-estimation) and persist it across a session boundary (Tier-2 constraint memory), still collapse-guarded (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: fr11_v12_drift_reset_and_cross_session_persistence_no_collapse_quality_maintained; results/experiment_3697_fr11_continuous_self_learning_v12.json
